## 5. Debugging Log — All Bugs Fixed

| Phase | Bug | Root Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|---|
| **1** | Wrong data paths | Scripts used `./data/dataco/` (non-existent) | Changed to actual folder names |
| **1–5** | Scripts depended on each other's variables | Phase 2–5 read `demand_grouped` from memory | Made each phase read from `.parquet` files |
| **2b** | `optuna` not installed | Missing dependency | `pip install optuna==4.8.0` |
| **3** | Infinite hang | `math.haversine()` called in O(n²) Python loop | Pre-computed vectorized NumPy distance matrix |
| **3, 4** | `UnicodeEncodeError` | `→` `–` chars can't encode in Windows `cp1252` | Replaced with ASCII `->` and `-` |
| **3** | Phase 3 was a copy of Phase 4 | Original files were identical | Rewrote Phase 3 as actual VRP algorithm |
| **5a** | `@app.on_event` DeprecationWarning | Deprecated in FastAPI ≥ 0.93 | Replaced with `asynccontextmanager lifespan` |
| **5a** | `torch.load()` security warning | Missing `weights_only=True` in PyTorch 2.x | Added parameter |
| **5a** | `DemandLSTM` undefined | Class not imported in server file | Embedded class definition in 5a |
| **5a** | Scaler not saved/loaded | Phase 2c saved model but not scaler | Added `joblib.dump(scaler)` + load in 5a |
| **5b** | `NameError: np` | `numpy` not imported | Added `import numpy as np` |
| **5b** | Wrong CSV path (Overview) | `./data/dataco/...` doesn't exist | Fixed to `DataCo Smart Supply Chain/...` |
| **5b** | Relative `./reports/` path breaks | CWD-sensitive path | Changed to `os.path.join(ROOT, 'reports', ...)` |
| **5b** | Route Optimizer page empty | No implementation | Built full page with table, chart, map |
| **5b** | Silent API failures | No error handling on `requests.post()` | Added `st.error()` + connection error catch |

