## 8. How to Run (Step-by-Step)

```powershell
# Step 1 — Data loading, EDA, and feature engineering
python phase1_data_loading.py

# Step 2 — Train all forecasting models (run independently)
python phase2a_arima_baseline.py     # SARIMA baseline (~2 min)
python phase2b_xgboost_forecast.py   # XGBoost + Optuna (~5 min)
python phase2c_lstm_model.py         # LSTM training (~2 min on CPU)

# Step 3 — Route optimisation
python phase3_route_optimization.py  # ~7 seconds

# Step 4 — Inventory plan generation
python phase4_inventory_optimization.py  # ~15 seconds

# Step 5 — Start API server (keep terminal open)
python phase5a_fastapi_server.py

# Step 6 — Launch Streamlit dashboard (new terminal)
streamlit run phase5b_streamlit_dashboard.py
# Open: http://localhost:8501
```

